# Comments

Write comments and XML documentation in Russian. Use English identifiers.
Apply the three-line XML summary rule in the Domain layer (see `domain/summaries.mdc`). In Application, Api, Domain.Data and other layers, document a member when it needs an explanation.
Use implementation comments to explain an ordering constraint, an invariant or a surprising case.
